From 59e44567f2dc239d93ac467f3a75a8ea51baf1b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:16:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: expose typed chain verification progress and disk
 consistency results

Convert ten existing VerifyDB messages without changing check depth, level, progress cadence, failure branches or Info severity. Keep readable diagnostics and copy hashes without caller formatting. Add exact integer fields for check depth/level and percent; extend the actual-producer functional check to verifychain.

Scripted diff commands (ast-grep-py==0.51.0):
