/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/test_convert.py
python3 test/lint/lint-log-events.py src/validation.cpp
Support adjustment: three appended registry fields, explicitly recorded. Fixtures15/15, source lint42sites, Ruff0.15.8 and idempotence pass. Updated native/runtime gate pending scheduler.
